{
  "comment": "Access groups 0Б: every Hasura permission requires the user's effective permission (user_effective_permissions) and, for order rows, the order scope. Applied by ops/hasura/access-predicates.sh; the frontend mirror of the write rules is src/utils/resourcePermissions.ts HASURA_WRITE_PERMISSIONS.",
